{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9130d9bc90b8167b71a6b45fc803d14f09160f1bcdd2c75578a0322379303dc0",
      "text": "那三个人，感情变得越来越好了呢。\n毕竟是同龄人，果然更容易合得来吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95a1fdca463897b770303c094962c8c543b1ddb3b0bf67e112ad3b466550ebfd",
      "text": "这应该也是原因之一，不过那三个人里，\n有乐队队长、",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f9268fc791350da5ab570b3ea99ade4e5afdb9f04477aba63bac5a62eba7cb",
      "text": "有学校老大的搭档，还有学生会长，\n可能也是因为各自的立场让他们很有共同语言吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42c93fb41f13629c370aba0c9fd13266e1d52445fb3913f0976426c24899293",
      "text": "确实如此呢。不过单就年龄来说，\n龙先生其实也和他们差不了多少吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c071f4ac2353009f76b2000346207e0f29daf54acc23981bf3045343af286364",
      "text": "年龄最接近的是锐心君吧。\n既然只差两岁，按说应该也会很有共同话题才对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe359311ac1bbf9abf070f9f1ba4b5cb1969ed5b639aee7a92c63cf6e03ae889",
      "text": "哎呀，其实并不是那样哦。\n相差两个年级的差距可大了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27942cfd883dcc62e0b1f47fb6cb349114e02e02e6714a4c84453deef0fa0c7b",
      "text": "现在流行的事情，\n跟我还是学生的时候完全不一样，让我吓了一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b12911b7d45fa9d442a7a154e946abd15e1b70a8cac2009a6d94ac8c6043b96e",
      "text": "哈哈。那要是换成我掺和进去，\n岂不是会让他们吓得更厉害了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df76cd49bcba0f0a56753ccdbf9b5e8d0cc6041d92902158bbdbf92f4f5a5294",
      "text": "渡边先生、木村先生。我们的准备已经就绪了。\n可以开始正式拍摄了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdc0d89be8be1514f82336f8d34179741682860591248680ee42f712aa13a8c2",
      "text": "哎呀，已经到这个时间啦！\n不好意思，不知不觉就聊入迷了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3fe0cfcf10e9a36d02baac7d7249cb11b47c3e203946eb2fbc6d4b1aee7f60",
      "text": "那个，我突然觉得……龙先生和实先生，\n关系真的很要好呢。刚才也聊得很开心的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8ed6c2ca6187a55ce9de1cb128a1bd3812401d0ec8151f07c4cc0d79388e0f6",
      "text": "对啊，本大爷也是这么觉得的。\n果然这就是所谓的成年人之间更容易有共同话题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dbafe3cf9a0ec3fcdcbfe3426fe5df615ba79cb352079c71e9070476fcdd2bb",
      "text": "……哈哈。看来你们三个，也跟我们\n在琢磨同样的事情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a7e4a67d828053360db22433b53835c77f16abbd16476d83ed2f51769802fe",
      "text": "“也”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8beb1879d7489922139000a0b4b8ce794ed99a4d360559c68f8f0c23b6acce3b",
      "text": "没事，只是刚才我们也在聊着，\n觉得那三个高中生关系真好呢。感觉两边挺像的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
